===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A large [[drinking]] [[vessel]], sometimes of [[pewter]], sometimes with a [[glass]] [[base]], with one [[handle]] and often a [[hinge]]d [[cover]].[[File:Kürschnerkanne, Braunschweig, 1900 (3).jpg|thumb|Tankard]]
#: {{ux|en|I sure would be much happier with a '''tankard''' of mead right about now.}}
